  "title": "Set yoghurt fermentation (template)",
  "notes": "Template for a set-yoghurt process study: starter culture, inoculation rate, incubation temperature and milk solids-non-fat are the planned factors; the protein content of each milk batch is measured (mid-infrared analyser) before inoculation. Fermentation ends at pH 4.6; texture and syneresis are measured after 24 h at 4 °C and acceptability by a consumer panel on a 9-point hedonic scale. Choose a design under Design (for example an optimal design with a quadratic model) to create the runs.",
